tz, Conseiller de son Altesse à Hanover.</i> </p>\n","number":"21.","title":"VINCENT PLACCIUS AN LEIBNIZ","date":"Hamburg, 27. November (7. Dezember) 1686. [20.29.]"}
      </script>

      <!-- Detailed scholarly view with line numbers -->
